            "review_text": "Meagan d\nMitcham, Australia224 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in Hoi An\nJun 2026 • Couples\nHidden gem!!!\nLocated behind Wafaifo Resort this restaurant is outstanding. Phuc and Hoa provide an outstanding service and the chef is to be highly commended for the delicious flavours and beautiful presentation of every dish. We cannot recommend this restaurant more highly. Thank you for an amazing meal and friendly professional service. We will be back.\nRead more\nWritten June 9, 2026",
